    "body": "Select the dedicated public Version Control Services Section repository while preserving the original source and current Git/Software Forge selections. The exact original13 regular files (157,173 bytes), dated inactive legacy implementation/tests/ownership/host requirements and both child gitlinks remain available under the new source owner. The current Software Forge advance is preserved.\n\nThis replaces the embedded section with its received source gitlink, relocates only the two child declarations into that section and adds one curated source-composition record. All50 unrelated parent leaves and21 other module declarations are unchanged. The original parent history remains intact; no runtime package/version or historical/native capability qualification is claimed.\n\nThe complete projection is independently received (8449bda7500922b3720d6427089ef1b85506df9c3b82a6b957feb22fe44c1f67); there are no current parent workflows. This ready PR is intended for the original authenticated source-handoff bridge and scheduled intake pulse. It will not be manually merged.",
